    "updated_at": "2017-08-07T20:38:25Z",
    "body": "Yeah that's a good point.  @hsivonen, AFAIK only Firefox has such a guard, right?  Do you know of any Android devices still within their support lifetime that ship with a dialer that has this problem? If so, I can try to find someone on the Android team to comment on whether mitigating this should be the responsibility of the browser (they'll care in particular about the system WebView based on chromium) or not.",
